- clone the podman-blank project https://gitea.com/Wail_Y/Podman-Blank
- this website can work without root, if necessary, redirect the 80/443 ports to another port
- adapt it to Prof (by replacing the work blank/Blank by your new project name)
- copy and adapt the blank.conf (to profweb.conf)
- generate TLS certificates and keys and point to them from the Mojolicious container
- prepare the domain name with emails for sending messages and adapt the configuration file
